{"id":"3cb367216d9bd61d","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal.md","title":"Bachmann–Howard Ordinal","display":"df-bachmann-howard-ordinal — Bachmann–Howard Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal","aliases":["18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal","18-df-060"],"display":"df-bachmann-howard-ordinal — Bachmann–Howard Ordinal","depends_on":["[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]]","[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"§9.5 immediately before Theorem 9.5.6","source_printed_pages":"181","source_pdf_pages":"191","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal</span><span>18-df-060</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bachmann-howard-ordinal — Bachmann–Howard Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d042b39a8b79bc06\" href=\"?note=d042b39a8b79bc06\" title=\"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function\">18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.5 immediately before Theorem 9.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"181"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"191"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\omega_1\">\\(\\Omega=\\omega_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\psi:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d042b39a8b79bc06\" href=\"?note=d042b39a8b79bc06\" title=\"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function\">18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function</a> 的 Veblen 闭包崩塌函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}\">\\(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}\\)</span> 是下式引入的序数，采用原书把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 本身算作 epsilon 点的标准枚举下标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}:=\n\\min\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\Omega&lt;\\xi\\ \\land\\ \\omega^\\xi=\\xi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{BH}:=\\psi(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}:=\n\\min\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\Omega&lt;\\xi\\ \\land\\ \\omega^\\xi=\\xi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{BH}:=\\psi(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 p.181 的 Bachmann–Howard ordinal。公式显式固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}\">\\(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}\\)</span> 为严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 的最小 epsilon 点，避免仅靠名字或错误调用未定义的 epsilon 枚举。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 必须取原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function","status":"resolved","id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function","status":"resolved","id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；$\\psi:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega$ 是 [[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 的 Veblen 闭包崩塌函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega=\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}:=\n\\min\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\Omega<\\xi\\ \\land\\ \\omega^\\xi=\\xi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{BH}:=\\psi(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1449,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal]]"},{"id":"7d64cebf443a3f29","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\|\\cdot\\|,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\Pi^1_1}$ 采用 [[18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的带实现理论呈示与一般良基 PR 关系秩口径。$\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K$ 从现行概念入口导入；比较不依赖未展开的“标准集合论解释”。$\\mathrm{BH}$ 见 [[18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal]]。 下式的 $\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K$ 直接使用 [[18-thm-id1-kp-ordinal]] 所定义的同一呈示，不在本文件再次定义。"},{"id":"aa6b01d732017d3a","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^\\flat,\\mathrm{ATR}_0^\\flat,\\iota_{\\mathrm{ATR}}$ 见 [[18-df-atr0]]；该节点保留全部算术理解和先前切片并集的递归模式，并给出双类到单类的有限推导。$\\mathcal D(\\vec X),\\iota_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 见 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]。所有范数采用 [[18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的明确呈示。$\\varepsilon_0,\\Gamma_0,\\mathrm{BH}$ 分别见 [[18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal]]、[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]、[[18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal]]；$L_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\vec X)$ 只作一元关系扩张。 下式的 $L_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\vec X),\\mathrm{PA}(\\vec X),\\mathfrak P_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak A$ 使用 [[18-thm-ordinal-comparison]] 的定义；本节点不重复定义这些对象。"},{"id":"6b282f1972a35fb5","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\|\\cdot\\|,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\Pi^1_1}$ 采用 [[18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的带实现理论呈示与一般良基 PR 关系秩口径。$\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K$ 由下式定义；比较不依赖未展开的“标准集合论解释”。$\\mathrm{BH}$ 见 [[18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"9a09ccaf5288aab0","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^\\flat,\\mathrm{ATR}_0^\\flat,\\iota_{\\mathrm{ATR}}$ 见 [[18-df-atr0]]；该节点保留全部算术理解和先前切片并集的递归模式，并给出双类到单类的有限推导。$\\mathcal D(\\vec X),\\iota_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 见 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]。所有范数采用 [[18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的明确呈示。$\\varepsilon_0,\\Gamma_0,\\mathrm{BH}$ 分别见 [[18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal]]、[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]、[[18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal]]；$L_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\vec X)$ 只作一元关系扩张。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-15","location